      "updated": 1792555828930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "pydanticAI 根据函数类型提示+文档注释，自动编译给llm实例调用，返回执行结果：\n\n1. read_file（read_and_register执行）：检查是否已读，错误反馈，调用read_and_register\n2. edit_file：改部分文本\n3. write_file：覆盖文本、新建文本\n4. run_command：执行任意comand，前置注册检查权限、白名单机制\n5. ask_user_question：提问用户、UI交互、返回用的选择\n6. task_create：执行任意comand，创建单个task\n7. task_list：执行任意comand，list全部tasks\n8. task_get：执行任意comand，调取单个task\n9. task_update：执行任意comand，更新某个task内容",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "pydanticAI 根据函数类型提示+文档注释，自动编译给llm实例调用，返回执行结果：\n\n1. read_file（read_and_register执行）：检查是否已读，错误反馈，调用read_and_register\n2. edit_file：改部分文本\n3. write_file：覆盖文本、新建文本\n4. run_command：执行任意comand，前置注册检查权限、白名单机制\n5. ask_user_question：提问用户、UI交互、返回用的选择\n6. task_create：执行任意comand，创建单个task\n7. task_list：执行任意comand，list全部tasks\n8. task_get：执行任意comand，调取单个task\n9. task_update：执行任意comand，更新某个task内容",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vjBuuSX9bV9Wq2q0w12v-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3702.4039310573344,
      "y": -753.729073724141,
      "width": 923.9987182617188,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "6QiM2PxUKuq3zSmnxpARb"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Zd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 734882428,
      "version": 1676,
      "versionNonce": 1572459881,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792589386367,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "def read_and_register(state: ReadFileState, path: str, offset: int = 1, limit: int | None = None) -> str:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: #先读一遍\n        content = f.read()  \n\n    ...处理格式...\n    # 它把磁盘上的文件文本按行拆成列表，把人类习惯的“从第 100 行开始”换算成 Python 列表索引 [99:149]；\n       \n    state.record(path, selected_content, offset=offset, limit=limit) #更新filestate\n\n    result = _with_line_numbers(selected_content, start_line=offset) #加行号给大模型\n    if truncated:\n        result += f\"\\n\\n（文件共 {total} 行，还有 {total - end} 行未显示。用 offset={end + 1} 继续读取）\"\n    # 切出这部分内容存入账本，最后加上右对齐的行号（并在没读完时带上“续读指南”）拼接成漂亮的字符串返回给大模型\n    return result\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "def read_and_register(state: ReadFileState, path: str, offset: int = 1, limit: int | None = None) -> str:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: #先读一遍\n        content = f.read()  \n\n    ...处理格式...\n    # 它把磁盘上的文件文本按行拆成列表，把人类习惯的“从第 100 行开始”换算成 Python 列表索引 [99:149]；\n       \n    state.record(path, selected_content, offset=offset, limit=limit) #更新filestate\n\n    result = _with_line_numbers(selected_content, start_line=offset) #加行号给大模型\n    if truncated:\n        result += f\"\\n\\n（文件共 {total} 行，还有 {total - end} 行未显示。用 offset={end + 1} 继续读取）\"\n    # 切出这部分内容存入账本，最后加上右对齐的行号（并在没读完时带上“续读指南”）拼接成漂亮的字符串返回给大模型\n    return result\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
